	(text "Main power relay (+) = 24V (on) / Floating (off) - High side controlled by sensor relays\nMain power relay (-) = GND (on) / Floating (off) - Low side controlled by MCU\nDust warning signal 1 = 24V (warning) / Floating (no warning) - When dust bin should be emptied, but machine can still run\nDust warning signal 2 = 24V (warning) / Floating (no warning) - When dust bin should be emptied, and machine cannot run\nLow pressure signal = 24V (low pressure) / Floating (high pressure) - Goes to 24V when sprinkler activates\nGate N = GND (open) / Floating (closed)\nDust sensor loop 1 = 4-20 mA depending on sensor value\nDust sensor loop 2 = 4-20 mA depending on sensor value (with slightly lower voltage)\n\n3.3V = Internal voltage regular for ESP32\n5V = Buck regulator output\n24V = Used for external components, buck regulator input"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.416 220.726 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "03ea6ca2-a0e2-4ade-b415-650e8c64b2ec")
	)
